		line-height: 44px;
		text-align: center;
		border-radius: 12px;
		font-size: 15px;
		font-weight: 500;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		margin: 0 4px;
	}

	.approve-btn.pass {
		background-color: #f5f5f7;
